          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "▪︎vs E. coli → GI/post-op sepsis · Pseudomonas → prolonged ICU/ventilation · neutropenic · S. aureus → neutropenic · indwelling vascular devices"
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
